{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19169","headline":"和白侍郎送令狐相公镇太原 · 刘禹锡","name":"和白侍郎送令狐相公镇太原","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十万天兵貂锦衣，晋城风日斗生辉。\n行台仆射深恩重，从事中郎旧路归。\n叠鼓蹙成汾水浪，闪旗惊断塞鸿飞。\n边庭自此无烽火，拥节还来坐紫微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19169.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19169","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}